23:  *    - Explicit overrides (launchParams or query) strictly preserved against dynamic port updates
24:  * 5. Disconnection & Auto-Reconnection:
25:  *    - Disconnection sets state.lunaSubscribed = false and schedules auto-reconnection
26:  * 6. Stream Resolution & View Routing:
27:  *    - PlayerController._fetchStreamResolution queries the dynamically resolved proxyBaseUrl
28:  */
