## 1. Observation

### 1.1 Priority Cascade in `app/js/config.js`
In `app/js/config.js` (lines 120–161):
```javascript
// Base query params
for (var q in urlParams) {
  if (Object.prototype.hasOwnProperty.call(urlParams, q)) {
    params[q] = urlParams[q];
  }
}

// PalmSystem launch parameters take absolute precedence over URL query parameters
for (var k in palmParams) {
  if (Object.prototype.hasOwnProperty.call(palmParams, k)) {
    params[k] = palmParams[k];
  }
}

// Exact prioritized cascade in resolving proxyBaseUrl:
// launchParams.proxyUrl > URL query ?proxyUrl= > localStorage.getItem('cinejoy_proxy_url') > default 'http://127.0.0.1:8088'
var resolvedProxyUrl = null;
var hasExplicitOverride = false;
var proxySource = 'default';

if (palmParams && palmParams.proxyUrl) {
  resolvedProxyUrl = palmParams.proxyUrl;
  hasExplicitOverride = true;
  proxySource = 'launchParams';
} else if (urlParams && urlParams.proxyUrl) {
  resolvedProxyUrl = urlParams.proxyUrl;
  hasExplicitOverride = true;
  proxySource = 'query';
} else if (savedProxy) {
  resolvedProxyUrl = savedProxy;
  hasExplicitOverride = false;
  proxySource = 'localStorage';
} else {
  resolvedProxyUrl = 'http://127.0.0.1:8088';
  hasExplicitOverride = false;
  proxySource = 'default';
}

params.proxyUrl = resolvedProxyUrl;
CINEJOY_CONFIG.proxyBaseUrl = resolvedProxyUrl;
CINEJOY_CONFIG.hasExplicitProxyOverride = hasExplicitOverride;
CINEJOY_CONFIG.proxySource = proxySource;
```
Direct observation:
- Parsing strictly enforces that `palmParams.proxyUrl` is checked first. If truthy, `resolvedProxyUrl` receives `palmParams.proxyUrl`, `hasExplicitOverride` is set to `true`, and `proxySource` is `'launchParams'`.
- URL query string is checked second (`proxySource = 'query'`), setting `hasExplicitOverride = true`.
- `savedProxy` from `localStorage.getItem('cinejoy_proxy_url')` is checked third (`hasExplicitOverride = false`).
